                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The MDN <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigation_API\" rel=\"nofollow\">Navigation API documentation</a> has several pages that link to <a href=\"https://gigantic-honored-octagon.glitch.me/\" rel=\"nofollow\">this demo hosted on Glitch</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Because Glitch is going away, we are re-hosting the demo on the <code class=\"notranslate\">dom-examples</code> repo: see <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3196325391\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/dom-examples/issues/315\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/dom-examples/pull/315/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/dom-examples/pull/315\">mdn/dom-examples#315</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR updates all the remaining links to point to the new location. I've removed many of the links because, on reflection, it seemed over-the-top to link to the same demo from every page. The PR only links to those pages from the main landing page, the interface pages, and the <code class=\"notranslate\">Window.navigation</code> page.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">We shouldn't merge this PR until the accompanying <code class=\"notranslate\">dom-examples</code> PR is merged.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
