        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h2 dir=\"auto\">Description</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR removes <code class=\"notranslate\">[Glitch](https://glitch.com/)</code> occurrences.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I'm helping <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/chrisdavidmills/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/chrisdavidmills\">@chrisdavidmills</a> remove some of the Glitch demos.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Related</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3192002804\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40148\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40148/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40148\">#40148</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3195670409\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40170\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40170/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40170\">#40170</a></li>\n</ul>",
