        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Moving the <code class=\"notranslate\">{{DefaultAPISidebar(.*)}}</code> macro into front matter.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Changes:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Move <code class=\"notranslate\">DefaultAPISidebar</code> into front matter</li>\n<li>Update front matter schema to allow for this usage</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Before looking at <code class=\"notranslate\">APIRef</code>, we may want to move this macro first, which only touches 360 files.<br>\nThe <code class=\"notranslate\">APIRef</code> macro is used in 7,000+ files, so we can start small.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For the full <code class=\"notranslate\">APIRef</code> changes, see:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/compare/main...bsmth:content:api-sidebar?expand=1\">https://github.com/mdn/content/compare/main...bsmth:content:api-sidebar?expand=1</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3188596681\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40139\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40139/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40139\">#40139</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3143719092\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/rari/issues/237\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/rari/pull/237/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/rari/pull/237\">mdn/rari#237</a> (landed in <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/rari/releases/tag/v0.1.41\">rari v0.1.41</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
