        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Changes:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Rename <code class=\"notranslate\">files/sidebars/httpsidebar.yaml</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">files/sidebars/http.yaml</code></li>\n<li>Move <code class=\"notranslate\">{{httpsidebar}}</code> to front matter <code class=\"notranslate\">sidebar: http</code></li>\n<li>update page templates where we reference the older one</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">We are tidying up sidebar macros in favor of front matter now.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3019751397\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39274\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/39274/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39274\">#39274</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2986000012\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39065\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/39065/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39065\">#39065</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3182763380\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40107\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40107/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40107\">#40107</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40167",
            "title": "chore: Move HTTP sidebar into front matter",
            "date_modified": "2025-07-02T08:54:10.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-07-02T07:46:53.000Z",
