        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12285999?u=183d27a6aca0718cb83ecec3c8e7745502384f48&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Adds missing <code class=\"notranslate\">duplex</code> property to <code class=\"notranslate\">RequestInit</code> (alphabetically between <code class=\"notranslate\">credentials</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">headers</code>).</li>\n<li>Documents <code class=\"notranslate\">TypeError</code> behavior in <code class=\"notranslate\">fetch()</code> exceptions table when:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">body</code> is a <code class=\"notranslate\">ReadableStream</code> but <code class=\"notranslate\">duplex</code> is omitted/not <code class=\"notranslate\">\"half\"</code>.</li>\n<li>Invalid <code class=\"notranslate\">duplex</code> values are provided.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #40086.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3177025829\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40086\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40086/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40086\">#40086</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
